 "remarks": "Located in Park Tower, Stamford's premier luxury condominium, this exquisite two-bedroom, two-and-a-half-bath unit combines sophisticated living with the convenience of downtown Stamford, just steps away from world-class dining, shopping, entertainment, and everything the city has to offer. The sun-drenched interior showcases sleek contemporary design, new vinyl flooring throughout, and an open floor plan designed for maximum comfort and style, ideal for everyday living and entertaining. The beautifully updated kitchen features white cabinetry, stainless steel appliances, and a stunning granite center island overlooking the living area. Two updated en-suite bathrooms, spacious walk-in closets, and the convenience of an in-unit washer and dryer complete the thoughtfully designed interior. Step onto your private balcony and enjoy stunning views of downtown Stamford. Additional upgrades include three new HVAC units. Residents enjoy white-glove service with a 24-hour doorman and concierge, along with exceptional amenities including a state-of-the-art fitness center, indoor pool, rooftop terrace with BBQs and breathtaking city views, spacious common areas, secure covered parking, and a pet-friendly environment. A convenient shuttle to the Stamford train station, just five minutes away, makes commuting effortless. Move right in and experience the luxury and convenience of downtown living.",
